frame pointers unlike the caller: refused
stack checks unlike the caller: refused
frame pointers unlike the caller, with another target: refused
the flags of the caller, with another target: refused for its target
the flags of the caller, with no target set: refused for its target
the flags of the caller: loaded
poll insertion unlike the caller: as the rule for loaded code says
a phrase for the LLVM backend: the JIT cannot load code compiled by the LLVM backend; compile the code to load with the native backend
